      "content": "hey, i'm working on a script for this new gritty urban crime series. it's set in a pretty rough part of the city and i want the cast to feel authentic, not like some sanitized tv version of things. can you help me brainstorm some character archetypes for the detectives and the local criminal elements? i want the archetypes to reflect the actual social dynamics of an inner-city setting so it feels real and hard-hitting.",
